{"slug":"Practice/README","title":"연습 기록 규칙","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-16T17:56:47+09:00","minutes":1,"html":"<p>폴더 하나 = 문제/세션 하나.</p>\n<pre><code>Practice/\n  Python/\n    YYMMDD-short-english-title/\n      note.md      # 문제, 접근, 회고 + 관련 개념 백링크\n      solution.*    # 실제 코드 (주석에 관련 개념을 평문으로 표기)\n  Java/\n    YYMMDD-short-english-title/\n      note.md\n      solution.*\n</code></pre>\n<p>언어별로 <code>Practice/Python/</code>, <code>Practice/Java/</code> 아래에 날짜 폴더를 둔다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"note:Practice/Python/README\" class=\"wikilink\" data-note=\"Practice/Python/README\">Python 문제 목록</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"note:Practice/Java/README\" class=\"wikilink\" data-note=\"Practice/Java/README\">Java 문제 목록</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>note.md</code> 템플릿:</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># 제목</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 문제: (링크 또는 요약)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 유형: 디버깅 / 코드 리뷰 / 구현</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 접근</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(가설 → 검증 과정, 혹은 리뷰 코멘트)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 관련 개념</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">디버깅-루틴</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">코드-리뷰-체크리스트</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 회고</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(다음에 다르게 할 것)</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>코드 파일 주석에는 옵시디언 링크 문법(<code>[[ ]]</code>)이 렌더링되지 않으므로,\n<code># 관련: 디버깅-루틴.md</code> 같은 평문 표기만 남기고 실제 링크는 짝지어진 <code>note.md</code>에서 건다.\n예시는 <span class=\"wikilink-broken\">예시 폴더</span> 참고.</p>","toc":[],"backlinks":[{"slug":"index","title":"Study","excerpt":"AI 페어 프로그래밍 학습 기록."},{"slug":"MOC","title":"MOC — AI 페어 프로그래밍","excerpt":"이 볼트의 진입점. 개념 노트는 [[]]로 서로 연결하고, 연습 기록은 Practice 폴더에서 관련 개념 노트를 역링크한다."},{"slug":"Practice/Java/260810-string-equality-bug-java/index","title":"260810-string-equality-bug-java","excerpt":"상위: Java · Practice"},{"slug":"Practice/Java/260819-integer-division-bug-java/index","title":"260819-integer-division-bug-java","excerpt":"상위: Java · Practice"},{"slug":"Practice/Java/README","title":"Java","excerpt":"상위: Practice"},{"slug":"Practice/Python/260730-closure-bug/index","title":"260730-closure-bug","excerpt":"상위: Python · Practice"},{"slug":"Practice/Python/260730-ex